  8.6 AC TURN-ON / DROP-OUTS / ACOK_H
            The power supply will automatically turn-on when connected to the AC line under the condition that the PSON_L signal is
            pulled low and the AC line is within range. The ACOK_H signal is active-high. The timing diagram is shown in Figure and
            referenced in Table 4.


  OPERATING CONDITION                                  MIN   MAX    UNIT
  tAC VSB          AC Line to 90% VVSB                        2     sec
  tAC V1           AC Line to 90% V1                          2     sec        AC
  tACOK_H on1      ACOK_H signal on delay (start-up)         2000   ms       Input

  tACOK_H on2      ACOK_H signal on delay (dips)             100    ms
  tACOK_H off      ACOK_H signal off delay                    5     ms
                                                                              VSB                                                                tV1 rise
  tVSB V1 del      VSB to V1 delay                     10    500    ms
  tV1 holdup       Effective V1 holdup time            10           ms                           tAC VSB                 tVSB rise
  tVSB holdup      Effective VSB holdup time           20           ms         V1                                         tVSB V1 del

  tACOK_H V1       ACOK_H to V1 holdup                  7           ms
                                                                                                                     tAC V1
                                                                           PSON_L
  tACOK_H VSB      ACOK_H to VSB holdup                15           ms
  tV1 off          Minimum V1 off time                  1     2     sec                     tACOK_H on1
                                                                           ACOK_H
  tVSB off         Minimum VSB off time                 1     2     sec                                                            tPWOK_H del
                                                                           PWOK_H
   NOTE: AC short dips means below 10 ms;
         AC long dips means 10 ms to 100 ms

